val=interface_60:com_168,Profound decorative helm: Not required for the set bonus.
val=interface_60:com_169,Profound decorative body: Wearing platebody, platelegs and shield together gives +25% damage against players, +10% damage against barricades and ballistas, and immunity to catapult and ballista damage.
