val=interface_60:com_171,Profound decorative shield: Wearing platebody, platelegs and shield together gives +25% damage against players, +10% damage against barricades and ballistas, and immunity to catapult and ballista damage.
val=interface_60:com_172,Profound decorative sword: Not required for the set bonus.
